{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_title", "source_sha256": "8dae8522dc43fece858be2bf90a5038dc14fe58b8265f689afb65bb334ee8125", "ja": "のり子とおでかけ2", "zh": "和法子外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f51ef8ad1c6abf5fba7030a399d83f411743dae5cb3fd43c7d2c0ce88816313a", "ja": "のり子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和法子一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0df811e1007f9231bf8a881b036ea72917816a2ba9607b0251e83ea3ce4d2bfc", "ja": "（ツアー中のオフ、のり子と一緒に大須商店街に来た。\nのり子には、目いっぱい楽しんでもらおう！）", "zh": "（巡演期间休息时，和纪子一起来到了大须商店街。一定要让纪子尽情享受！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "480f8bd4234140fe97946e0abe9bdddb81aace270265932502615331c9f6e91a", "ja": "大須って面白いね、{$P$}！\n個性的なお店が多いしサブカルっぽい雰囲気もあって！", "zh": "大须真有意思啊，{$P$}！\n不仅有个性的小店很多，还很有亚文化的氛围！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "40f93f356b43fc217fdaa203f753c74459d99d8db0a2fb6f1e54d55082e51c78", "ja": "そうだな。古着屋さんにアニメショップ、雑貨店……\nそれに、食べ歩きも色々楽しめそうだ。", "zh": "是啊。古着店、动漫商店、杂货店……\n而且还能一路品尝各种美食，感觉也会很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "f7970119bd128b017d3a22d79dba33e631841f9b70dbdd0278b03cc7aafaf542", "ja": "へ～っ、古着屋さんかぁ。アタシ、古着とか全然\n詳しくないからなぁ。あっ、でもカワイイかも……？", "zh": "哦～，古着店啊。我对古着什么的完全不了解呢。不过，嗯，说不定很可爱……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b50a6e1569d6343b84b289d4328d146d8d023c7399bc416a48e6997870c11a11", "ja": "気になるのか？　よし、さっそく行ってみよう。", "zh": "你很感兴趣吗？好，那我们马上去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "9d321e8408a5964997813bb8f7a903ec3d31e1a56d5fca31d381313b23b13550", "ja": "う、ううん！　アタシにはちょっと可愛すぎるから、\nいいや！　それより、唐揚げとか食べようよ！？", "zh": "不、不对！对我来说有点太可爱了，\n算了！比起这个，我们去吃炸鸡块吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2a29a6dfd31841d7815ca3a0669cc5a44414d9db2edbc4a57eccdae5115cb910", "ja": "唐揚げは後でも食べられるだろ。\n見るだけでもいいから、ほら！", "zh": "炸鸡之后也能吃嘛。\n就算只是看看也好，快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "861790837f31ea6e921e7eb453d0007ef1c00b6f6adfeec3f124bba22e57f90a", "ja": "あっ！　ちょっと待ってよ{$P$}！\nも～、強引なんだから～！", "zh": "啊！等一下啦{$P$}！\n真是的～，也太强硬了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "f428e8a5aaa815bda5485fc2c354fc7307cbdd67e307696aa318dc660077a398", "ja": "えへ、えへへへへ……いっぱい買っちゃった。\nっていうか、{$P$}のせいだからね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿……一不小心买了好多。话说，还不是因为{$P$}嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6ac449241653eba5be278807a213c9962da86937a85125fd7e64dcc7c12cbead", "ja": "いいじゃないか、どれもすごく似合ってたし。あの、\n大きめなフリルのワンピースとか、特に可愛かったな！", "zh": "有什么不好的嘛，每件都非常适合你啊。\n那条荷叶边比较大的连衣裙，就格外可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "0571dec34c266f7a408aeb1600fe594937231d9aa454573816f351da529a8199", "ja": "かわっ！？　……あー！　あーもー、そういうのナシ！\nアタシがこれ以上勘違いしたらどうするの！　もう！", "zh": "可、可爱！？……啊——！啊真是的，不许再说这种话了！要是我再这样误会下去怎么办！真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2a7fa6f4a6febee545f663d38ce1354ceb77dee96e27aa1d5ddebb3341222e83", "ja": "別に勘違いでもなんでもないよ。\nのり子が可愛いのは、本当だからな！", "zh": "这才不是什么误会啊。\n法子很可爱，这是真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor02_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "c8e67e2c29c8acc8e15155231aa8bbf62cc42f18b106d2ca487c946c506c7c35", "ja": "も、も～～～っ！　本当にいいから……！\n{$P$}、唐揚げ食べに行くよ！", "zh": "真、真是的～～～！真的不用再说了啦……！\n{$P$}，去吃炸鸡块啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
